# The firework rocket's behaviour is not ported yet. 1.20.6's FireworkRocketEntity rides a gliding
# player and adds look * 0.1 + (look * 1.5 - velocity) * 0.5 to their velocity every tick, and
# nothing in mod_api.json spawns that entity or changes a player's velocity. The rocket has no
# recipe of its own: mods/jei spawns it in. about.json records the gap as a deviation against #915.
